WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:32.375
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.083
that one who has conquered their mind

3
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:36.916
has realized Paramātmā

4
00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:40.041
within themselves, and such a yogi

5
00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:43.375
has risen above all dualities

6
00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:44.208
like pleasure and pain,

7
00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:47.958
cold and heat, honor and dishonor.

8
00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:50.583
Now in this eighth verse, Lord Krishna

9
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.000
is explaining some more qualities

10
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.416
of such a yogi,

11
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:57.083
and here we will also learn the difference

12
00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:59.416
between jnāna and vijnāna.

13
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.000
Lord Krishna says

14
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.458
that one who has satisfied themselves

15
00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:10.291
through jnāna and vijnāna,

16
00:01:10.291 --> 00:01:12.875
and has conquered the senses,

17
00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.416
will remain stable,

18
00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:17.708
will not waver. And for such a person,

19
00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:21.416
mud, stone, and gold are all the same.

20
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:24.000
In spiritual context,

21
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.666
understanding the meaning and difference

22
00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:28.250
of jnāna and vijnāna is important.

23
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:31.166
Jnāna is only the knowledge of principles.

24
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:32.208
Vijnāna is

25
00:01:32.208 --> 00:01:35.250
adopting knowledge in practical form.

26
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.583
Vijnāna is when knowledge is acted upon

27
00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:42.583
and is personally experienced
 and adopted in life.

28
00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:45.416
A true yogi is not one who merely says

29
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:47.666
that renouncing desires is appropriate,

30
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:49.875
because this is only jnāna.

31
00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:51.375
A true yogi is one

32
00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:55.000
who has tested this through personal 
experience, meaning vijnāna,

33
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.666
and has acted upon it in life.

34
00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:00.500
And because of this deep understanding,

35
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.541
they are now satisfied from within.

36
00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:03.833
They remain stable

37
00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:06.500
in all circumstances and difficulties,

38
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:08.000
do not waver.

39
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.958
Worldly cravings don't affect them.

40
00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:13.833
They know the truth of their spiritual form,

41
00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.541
and their life remains focused

42
00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:18.958
on the purpose of realizing Paramātmā.

43
00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:22.083
For such a spiritually advanced person,

44
00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:24.625
materiality has no value at all.

45
00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:25.583
So then, what is mud,

46
00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:27.458
what is stone, what is gold –

47
00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:29.833
for them everything is the same.

48
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:32.333
Because that person knows

49
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.208
that materiality, however

50
00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:35.375
valuable it may appear,

51
00:02:35.375 --> 00:02:38.375
can only give momentary joy.

52
00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:42.000
And spirituality is the path
  of lasting contentment.

53
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.583
Understand what Krishna is 
saying in this verse –

54
00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:49.208
satisfaction is not possible
 from bookish knowledge alone.

55
00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:53.708
The spiritual principles of the
 Gita must be adopted in life.

56
00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:56.916
Both the joy related to them

57
00:02:56.916 --> 00:03:00.041
and the difficulties related 
to them must be experienced.

58
00:03:00.041 --> 00:03:03.250
Only then is it possible to fully

59
00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.583
grasp it.

60
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:08.375
The first stage of this transformation 
is gaining knowledge,

61
00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:11.500
the second stage is reflecting on it,

62
00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:15.791
the third stage is acting upon it,

63
00:03:15.791 --> 00:03:19.500
and finally, staying firm on it

64
00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.500
even amidst worldly cravings and difficulties.

65
00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:22.416
Only then

66
00:03:22.416 --> 00:03:26.208
have you grasped this knowledge like vijnāna.

67
00:03:26.208 --> 00:03:28.333
Then no ups and downs of life

68
00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:30.708
will be able to disturb you.

69
00:03:35.541 --> 00:03:37.875
Here, understand the difference

70
00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:41.208
between jnāna and vijnāna.

71
00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:44.916
Many people spend their lives
 collecting knowledge,

72
00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:47.291
they discuss it too,

73
00:03:47.291 --> 00:03:50.208
but

74
00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:52.791
when personal circumstances come,

75
00:03:52.791 --> 00:03:55.708
they cannot apply it.

76
00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:57.458
For example,

77
00:03:57.458 --> 00:04:00.291
someone reads about exercise,

78
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:02.750
talks about that topic too,

79
00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.458
but when it's time

80
00:04:04.458 --> 00:04:08.166
for discipline in personal life,

81
00:04:08.166 --> 00:04:09.833
they fail.

82
00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:12.625
Or a wealthy person

83
00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:14.666
talks about charity,

84
00:04:14.666 --> 00:04:17.541
follows it too,

85
00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:19.916
shows it off too,

86
00:04:19.916 --> 00:04:23.083
but all this continues only

87
00:04:23.083 --> 00:04:27.291
as long as they have piles of money.

88
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:30.500
As soon as income decreases a little,

89
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.708
they immediately stop charity.

90
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:37.916
Because they are attached to wealth.

91
00:04:37.916 --> 00:04:38.833
So then

92
00:04:38.833 --> 00:04:42.958
charity has been understood only superficially.

93
00:04:42.958 --> 00:04:46.291
Understanding and explaining
 knowledge is easy.

94
00:04:46.291 --> 00:04:50.000
But true change in life will come

95
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.291
when knowledge is fully adopted

96
00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:55.625
and grasped practically

97
00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:58.583
like vijnāna.

98
00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:01.583
Jnāna is knowing the principles,

99
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:03.083
and vijnāna is

100
00:05:03.083 --> 00:05:06.416
personally experiencing those principles

101
00:05:06.416 --> 00:05:08.833
and adopting them in life.

102
00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:11.208
When you adopt spirituality

103
00:05:11.208 --> 00:05:14.875
in true form, such sweet

104
00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:17.875
satisfaction is experienced that

105
00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:23.125
compared to it, every other joy seems pale.

106
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:24.375
Don't let these teachings

107
00:05:24.375 --> 00:05:28.166
of the Gita remain just knowledge.

108
00:05:28.166 --> 00:05:31.208
Gradually, by living these principles,

109
00:05:31.208 --> 00:05:33.750
adopt them like vijnāna.

110
00:05:38.375 --> 00:05:41.750
Here it's about grasping spiritual knowledge

111
00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.375
and making life satisfied.

112
00:05:45.375 --> 00:05:46.791
In family life,

113
00:05:46.791 --> 00:05:50.125
you can adopt this too.

114
00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:52.291
If you are an elder in the family,

115
00:05:52.291 --> 00:05:56.666
then perhaps you are now at that stage of life

116
00:05:56.666 --> 00:06:00.541
where you have fulfilled most of your family

117
00:06:00.541 --> 00:06:02.125
responsibilities.

118
00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:04.250
You have worked hard

119
00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:07.375
in life till now, nourished the family,

120
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:09.291
provided education to children,

121
00:06:09.291 --> 00:06:11.333
helped them.

122
00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:16.541
Now a new phase of life will begin.

123
00:06:16.541 --> 00:06:20.250
And at such a time,

124
00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:24.000
practically adopting spiritual
knowledge is essential.

125
00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.083
This is what will give you contentment.

126
00:06:27.083 --> 00:06:29.083
For example,

127
00:06:29.083 --> 00:06:30.750
at this stage of age,

128
00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.875
you do study spirituality,

129
00:06:33.875 --> 00:06:36.750
but still remain worried

130
00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.875
whether children are properly managing

131
00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:44.416
the business or wealth you created.

132
00:06:44.416 --> 00:06:46.625
If they make some mistake,

133
00:06:46.625 --> 00:06:48.791
you get disturbed.

134
00:06:48.791 --> 00:06:52.500
You interfere again and again.

135
00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.500
So in such a case,

136
00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.833
spirituality has remained only verbal knowledge.

137
00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:04.166
You haven't grasped it like vijnāna, 
as experience.

138
00:07:04.166 --> 00:07:05.541
Because

139
00:07:05.541 --> 00:07:10.041
the mind is still stuck in wealth and property.

140
00:07:10.041 --> 00:07:13.833
True spiritual progress will happen

141
00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:21.000
when you remove attachment from the business
 you created, from wealth or property.

142
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:29.166
You will trust that your children will manage
both family and business well,

143
00:07:29.166 --> 00:07:34.708
just as you did in your youth.

144
00:07:34.708 --> 00:07:40.000
This doesn't mean you 
shouldn't help even when needed.

145
00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.500
Just reduce interference.

146
00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:50.375
Getting disturbed at every
 mistake of children is futile. Trust them.

147
00:07:50.375 --> 00:07:54.083
You too learned from your own mistakes.

148
00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:59.125
Let children have their own life experiences.

149
00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:07.458
And the more you connect with spirituality, 
all this will become easier.

150
00:08:07.458 --> 00:08:11.958
Because for a person whose
 mind is filled with spirituality,

151
00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:17.333
letting go of these attachments
 doesn't remain difficult.

152
00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:23.541
In such a case, you will automatically start 
giving up the desire to control.

153
00:08:23.541 --> 00:08:27.083
When needed, you will be able to guide

154
00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:30.375
the new generation without getting disturbed.

155
00:08:30.375 --> 00:08:34.041
They will listen to your
 every suggestion sincerely.

156
00:08:34.041 --> 00:08:39.916
Because now every suggestion
seems valuable to them,

157
00:08:39.916 --> 00:08:42.041
not interference.

158
00:08:42.041 --> 00:08:44.916
This will increase mutual love,

159
00:08:44.916 --> 00:08:47.750
increase self-confidence in children,

160
00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.708
they will get new experiences

161
00:08:49.708 --> 00:08:52.250
and will mature.

162
00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:55.458
And along with this, from your behavior,

163
00:08:55.458 --> 00:08:58.708
the new generation will also get this perspective –

164
00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:01.625
that worldly success is important,

165
00:09:01.625 --> 00:09:05.750
but it's not the only purpose of life.

166
00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.708
Spiritual progress

167
00:09:07.708 --> 00:09:09.875
is equally important.

168
00:09:09.875 --> 00:09:13.833
Remember, spiritual progress alone

169
00:09:13.833 --> 00:09:18.791
gives the ability to rise above worldly
 difficulties and challenges.

170
00:09:23.541 --> 00:09:26.083
In the professional field,

171
00:09:26.083 --> 00:09:28.208
there is an abundance of jnāna,

172
00:09:28.208 --> 00:09:31.166
but a lack of vijnāna.

173
00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:35.250
Many times in organizations,
 meetings are called,

174
00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.666
problems are reflected upon,

175
00:09:37.666 --> 00:09:40.583
plans are discussed.

176
00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:45.083
But when it's time to implement these plans,

177
00:09:45.083 --> 00:09:47.250
many things are missed,

178
00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:50.291
many solutions prove futile.

179
00:09:50.291 --> 00:09:53.250
Many times this happens

180
00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:54.625
because while making plans,

181
00:09:54.625 --> 00:09:57.833
officials ignored ground reality

182
00:09:57.833 --> 00:10:00.958
and experience.

183
00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:02.333
It's essential

184
00:10:02.333 --> 00:10:05.791
to consult those people too

185
00:10:05.791 --> 00:10:09.375
who work daily at ground level.

186
00:10:09.375 --> 00:10:12.291
Because ultimately, those same people

187
00:10:12.291 --> 00:10:16.833
will actualize the plan and make it successful.

188
00:10:16.833 --> 00:10:19.875
Similarly, a senior official

189
00:10:19.875 --> 00:10:22.875
verbally calling all colleagues

190
00:10:22.875 --> 00:10:27.000
important is not enough.

191
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.541
Because if the senior official

192
00:10:28.541 --> 00:10:32.125
doesn't demonstrate this in their behavior,

193
00:10:32.125 --> 00:10:34.708
then these words are useless.

194
00:10:34.708 --> 00:10:36.958
People will see actions, not words.

195
00:10:36.958 --> 00:10:40.583
They will consider that the truth.

196
00:10:40.583 --> 00:10:43.625
It's also essential for officials

197
00:10:43.625 --> 00:10:47.208
to regularly spend time with employees

198
00:10:47.208 --> 00:10:50.541
at their level,

199
00:10:50.541 --> 00:10:53.875
experience their daily routine.

200
00:10:53.875 --> 00:10:55.125
Only from this

201
00:10:55.125 --> 00:10:59.375
will jnāna change into vijnāna, as experience.
